    <h1 class="guide-hero__title">The Science of Falling Asleep Fast: Evidence-Based Techniques for Restless Nights</h1>
    <p class="guide-hero__desc">
      Why does sleep feel effortless on some nights and impossible on others? Discover the neurological mechanisms governing sleep onset latency and learn practical protocols to power down your nervous system.
    </p>
